# Committed dummy placeholder for the SEMOSS client — DO NOT EDIT.
#
# Vite bakes ENDPOINT, MODULE, and APP into the bundle at build time. The values
# below are harmless local-dev defaults. Real per-environment values belong in
# client/.env.local (gitignored), which overrides this file. Before every build,
# write .env.local for your target environment with all three keys:
#
#   APP=<app_id>
#   ENDPOINT=<base_url>
#   MODULE=<api_module_url>
#
# See the "Multi-environment workflow" section of ../CLAUDE.md and the
# semoss-deploy skill for the full flow.
ENDPOINT="http://localhost:9090/"
MODULE="/Monolith"
APP=""